  "label": "hateful_text_juxtaposition",
  "description": "A scene where a historical portrait of George Washington is overlaid with offensive text that uses racist and historically inaccurate analogies to justify slavery. The text falsely claims that enslaved people were made slaves because they are 'idiots' who are 'drinking beer, smoking weed, and shooting off Chinese fireworks' instead of protesting. The juxtaposition of Washington's image with this offensive text is intended to mock and insult Black people by implying they are inherently inferior and undeserving of freedom, while also misrepresenting the historical context of slavery.",
